**Held-out eval** (synthetic CUAD-style, n=40/50, 10 rate-limited):
- lfm-1.2b zero-shot: 92.5% accuracy, 0.937 macro-F1
- Label: **promising — internal regression verified. NOT production-ready.**

## RAG Implementation

Keyword-based retrieval proxy (no FAISS at runtime — FAISS used during training only):
- Scans clause text for domain keywords
- Returns up to 3 example snippets from training set
- Applied only to sub-7B models (`use_rag: true` in model chain)
- Lifts lfm-1.2b from 80% → 100% on test set

FAISS artifact: `clause_index_v2.faiss` (IndexFlatIP, 384-dim, 30 train vectors, `all-MiniLM-L6-v2` embedder)

## Intake Router

`POST /v1/legal/intake` classifies matter into 5 types and returns routing target:

| Matter Type | Routes To |
|---|---|
| contract | `/api/v1/legal/contract/analyze` |
| litigation | `/api/v1/legal/litigation/analyze` |
| ip | `/api/v1/legal/ip/analyze` |
| employment | `/api/v1/legal/employment/analyze` |
| corporate | `/api/v1/legal/corporate/analyze` |

